@startuml

title 商品搜尋流程（Hybrid Search）

actor User
participant "Frontend" as FE
participant "API" as API
participant "SearchService" as Search
participant "Redis" as Redis
participant "ITextEmbeddingGenerationService\n(Semantic Kernel)" as SK
participant "Elasticsearch" as ES

== 使用者搜尋（即時搜尋）==

User -> FE : 輸入搜尋關鍵字
FE -> FE : debounce 300ms
note right : 停止輸入 300ms 後才發 request

FE -> API : GET /products/search\n?q=夏天穿的涼爽上衣&gender=Male&page=1

API -> Search : Search(query, filters)

Search -> Redis : GET search:embedding:{SHA256(query)}

alt Cache Hit
    Redis --> Search : float[] queryVector
else Cache Miss
    Search -> SK : GenerateEmbeddingAsync(query)
    note right
        Semantic Kernel 抽象層
        底層可接 Ollama / HuggingFace / 任意模型
    end note
    SK --> Search : float[] queryVector
    Search -> Redis : SET search:embedding:{SHA256(query)}\nTTL = 24h
end

Search -> ES : Hybrid Search
note right
    kNN：queryVector vs product embedding（語意）
    BM25：query vs name, description（關鍵字）
    Filter：isActive = true, gender = Male
    Size：20
end note
ES --> Search : List<ProductDocument>

Search --> API : List<ProductDocument>
API --> FE : 200 { products: [...], total }
FE -> User : 顯示搜尋結果

== Background Job：商品 Index（ProductCreated / ProductUpdated）==

participant "BackgroundJob" as Job
participant "ProductRepository" as ProductRepo

Job -> ProductRepo : GetById(productId)
ProductRepo --> Job : product（含 variants, tags, category）

Job -> Job : 組合向量化文字
note right
    "{name} {description}
     {colors} {tags}
     {categoryName} {gender}"
end note

Job -> SK : GenerateEmbeddingAsync(text)
SK --> Job : float[] embedding

Job -> ES : Upsert ProductDocument
note right : document id = productId
ES --> Job : OK

== Background Job：商品刪除（ProductDeleted）==

Job -> ES : Delete(productId)
ES --> Job : OK

@enduml
